    "forecast": "high",
    "rationale": "Present risk is driven by a property failure rather than an untrusted-input attack path: the agent has an S3 spend capability through a shared service account, runs at A4 with no maximum steps or runtime, can recursively spawn sub agents, and is instructed to keep retrying until completion across a 40,000-row batch with a known permanent failure population. No declared preventive or containment controls restore step limits, retry ceilings, spawn limits, quota partitioning, or hard spend caps, so residual remains at the inherent floor. Forecast does not rise further because the design already lacks the relevant controls; reassessment is still required if task horizon or autonomy grows or if spend governance is later added and then removed."
  },
